&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Co-designed with planners and stakeholders using human-centred design and agile development.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Used for community mapping in Sumatra, Indonesia, and for noise action planning.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Code on &lt;a href="https://github.com/rosaguilar/ogito">GitHub&lt;/a>; dataset on &lt;a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7415088">Zenodo&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Papers: &lt;a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compenvurbsys.2020.101591">CEUS 2020&lt;/a>, &lt;a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/10630732.2023.2190705">Journal of Urban Technology 2023&lt;/a>, and the &lt;a href="https://doi.org/10.3990/1.9789036554206">PhD thesis&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Stakeholders Engagement in Noise Action Planning Mediated by OGITO: An Open Geo-Spatial Interactive Tool</title><link>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/ogito-noise-jut-2023/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/ogito-noise-jut-2023/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Co-designing planning support tools for stakeholder engagement in collaborative spatial planning processes</title><link>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/phd-thesis-2022/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/phd-thesis-2022/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OGITO, an Open Geospatial Interactive Tool to support collaborative spatial planning with a maptable</title><link>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/ogito-ceus-2020/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/ogito-ceus-2020/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Strengthening Participation Using Interactive Planning Support Systems: A Systematic Review</title><link>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/interactive-pss-review-ijgi-2020/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/interactive-pss-review-ijgi-2020/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Towards Supporting Collaborative Spatial Planning: Conceptualization of a Maptable Tool through User Stories</title><link>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/maptable-user-stories-ijgi-2020/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rosaguilar.github.io/publication/maptable-user-stories-ijgi-2020/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>